53	 * opens a chat panel. Identifies the visitor with a persistent `visitorId` in
54	 * localStorage, posts messages to /api/chat, and polls GET /api/chat every ~4s
55	 * while open. On the very first message it optionally captures name + email.
56	 *
57	 * Mounted by the orchestrator (near <CookieConsent/> in app/layout.tsx) — it
58	 * does not mount itself anywhere.
